  "description": "Ticket #64 (F24), label SM: Service Mode On from power-on; every ADPCM command 0x81-0xbf played alone through its table-derived end, then 0x80 stops of active samples on each channel and substantial overlapping playback on both channels. Channel 1 is stopped through the service screen's exit helper because its samples end before menu navigation can select 0x80. Directions are held for ten frames per observed single step; heavy punch plays on release. Full checkpoints precede every command latch and close the run. Both MSM5205 hooks cover the frame before the first command through the run's end.",
